{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/113514","repository_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/113514/labels{/name}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/113514/comments","events_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/113514/events","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/113514","id":3690808306,"node_id":"PR_kwDOAO6SJc623Shn","number":113514,"title":"Optimize `RequiredParam` to not increase and decrease refcounts on call.","user":{"login":"Ivorforce","id":2308167,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIzMDgxNjc=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/2308167?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce","html_url":"https://github.com/Ivorforce","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"labels":[{"id":73330066,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWw3MzMzMDA2Ng==","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/enhancement","name":"enhancement","color":"aaccff","default":true,"description":"","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":279097966,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNzkwOTc5NjY=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:core","name":"topic:core","color":"ffee88","default":false,"description":"","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":580537003,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWw1ODA1MzcwMDM=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:gdextension","name":"topic:gdextension","color":"ffee88","default":false,"description":"","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":3240950060,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwzMjQwOTUwMDYw","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/performance","name":"performance","color":"447777","default":false,"description":"","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null}],"state":"closed","locked":false,"assignees":[],"milestone":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/milestones/23","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/milestone/23","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/milestones/23/labels","id":12939969,"node_id":"MI_kwDOAO6SJc4AxXLB","number":23,"title":"4.6","description":"","creator":{"login":"Repiteo","id":17489292,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3NDg5Mjky","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/17489292?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo","html_url":"https://github.com/Repiteo","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"open_issues":3,"closed_issues":2978,"state":"closed","created_at":"2025-05-22T16:25:52Z","updated_at":"2026-10-04T16:23:23Z","due_on":null,"closed_at":"2026-01-26T18:09:14Z"},"comments":1,"created_at":"2025-12-03T15:52:07Z","updated_at":"2025-12-03T23:13:17Z","closed_at":"2025-12-03T22:55:55Z","assignee":null,"author_association":"MEMBER","issue_field_values":[],"type":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"draft":false,"pull_request":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/113514","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/113514","diff_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/113514.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/113514.patch","merged_at":"2025-12-03T22:55:55Z"},"body":"- Follow-up of #86079 \r\n\r\nThis optimizes calls to `RequiredParam` functions, by avoiding changing the refcount temporarily.\r\n\r\n## Explanation\r\n\r\n#86079 introduced `RequiredParam` to mark `Object *` function parameters as required, i.e. calling it with `nullptr` is an error and will prevent the function from running normally.\r\n\r\nIn the case of `Object`, the functions used to take `T *`, and `RequiredParam<T>` compiles down to `T *`, so there is no change.\r\n\r\nIn the case of `RefCounted`, the functions (often) used to take `const Ref &`, which is a double indirection (which is _fairly_ cheap). With `RequiredParam`, they currently compile to `Ref<T>` instead, which makes the compiler increase and decrease the refcount for the duration of the call. This is fairly expensive (only slightly lower cost than an allocation).\r\n\r\nSince the caller is holding a reference to the `RefCounted`, increasing the refcount temporarily is unnecessary. We can avoid this by always storing `T *`. The only caveat is that the functions are used to dealing with `Ref<T>` instead of `T *`. For example, many functions take `Ref<T>&` as parameter, so holding a `T *` would make this impossible.\r\n\r\nSince `Ref<T>` is `T *` internally, we can simply pretend the held `T *` _is_ a `Ref<T>`, to hold the current API principles. In the future, we may want to optimize the current `const Ref &` cases too, to remove the double indirection, and remove the 'hack' of pretending `T *` is a `Ref<T>`.","closed_by":{"login":"Repiteo","id":17489292,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3NDg5Mjky","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/17489292?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo","html_url":"https://github.com/Repiteo","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/113514/reactions","total_count":4,"+1":1,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":2,"confused":0,"heart":1,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/113514/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":null}